.TH "TOOL-BUILD" "1" "September 28, 2026" "tool 2.3.1" "User Commands"
.SH "NAME"
tool\-build, tool\-b \- build the project
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
\fBtool build|b\fR [\fIoptions\fR] <entry> [extra...] [\fIcommand\fR]
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Build the project. Reads options from .toolrc if present.
.SH "ARGUMENTS"
.TP
\fB<entry>\fR
entry file
.TP
\fB[extra...]\fR
additional source files
.SH "OPTIONS"
.TP
\fB\-w, \-\-watch\fR
watch for changes
.TP
\fB\-o, \-\-output <dir>\fR
output directory (default: "dist")
.TP
\fB\-\-color\fR
use color output (default: true)
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
disable color output
.TP
\fB\-f, \-\-format <type>\fR
output format (choices: "esm", "cjs", "umd", default: "esm")
.TP
\fB\-\-token <token>\fR
registry auth token (env: TOOL_TOKEN)
.TP
\fB\-h, \-\-help\fR
display help for command
.SH "COMMANDS"
.TP
\fBwatch|w\fR [options]
Watch and rebuild on change
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR tool (1),
.BR tool\-build\-watch (1),
.BR tool\-deploy (1),
.BR tool\-lint (1)
